    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "\n\n\n\n<p>You've greatly improved your abilities and your core can support further augmentations. You gain the enhancement benefits of one of your 1st-, 5th-, 9th-, or 13th-level warforged ancestry feats.</p>\n<p>You are also capable of reconfiguring your augmentations to meet your needs. You can spend one week of downtime to change the enhancement you gain with this feat.</p>\n"
